Revision history for Data-SpatialHash-Shared

0.03      2026-07-17
          - Add a frozen read-only mode: freeze() seals a file-backed spatial
            hash immutable; new_readonly() opens it O_RDONLY / PROT_READ and
            queries it lock-free.
          - On-disk format change (v1 -> v2): an existing 0.02 file is
            refused; recreate it.
          - Security and robustness hardening.

0.02      2026-07-03
          - Security and robustness hardening; backing files now created mode
            0600 (pass a file-mode argument to new() for cross-user sharing).

0.01      2026-06-22
          - Initial release.
